  "text": "{\n  \"title\": \"Our understanding of the College's needs\",\n  \"text\": \"The College requires proposals to be submitted through its procurement portal as a single PDF of no more than 20 pages by 2026-12-01 12:00 UTC [REQ-0001]. The service must be live for students by 2027-01-11, the first day of spring enrollment [REQ-0012], and integrate with the College's student records system through its existing REST API [REQ-0008]. The Supplier shall keep an audit record of every signature event [REQ-0002], support signing on current desktop and mobile browsers [REQ-0003], send a reminder to each signer who has not signed within 72 hours [REQ-0004], and store signed documents for ten (10) years [REQ-0006]. The service shall be available 99.5% of the time in each calendar month, excluding planned maintenance announced five working days in advance [REQ-0010]. Furthermore, the Supplier should provide templates for the College's twelve most used forms [REQ-0005], migrate the signed records held in the current tool by 2027-02-28 [REQ-0007], respond to severity-one incidents within one hour at any time of day [REQ-0011], and may propose an on-premises deployment option [REQ-0009].\",\n  \"cited_ids\": [\n    \"REQ-0001\",\n    \"REQ-0002\",\n    \"REQ-0003\",\n    \"REQ-0004\",\n    \"REQ-0005\",\n    \"REQ-0006\",\n    \"REQ-0007\",\n    \"REQ-0008\",\n    \"REQ-0009\",\n    \"REQ-0010\",\n    \"REQ-0011\",\n    \"REQ-0012\"\n  ]\n}",
